    "detailed_description": "<h1>Check out the game from our friends!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>&quot;The Last Orgasm&quot; is a daring plunge into a dystopian future where human sexuality has been warped and weaponized. This adult-only first-person shooter combines explicit sexual content with pulse-pounding horror and combat elements, challenging you to face your fears and desires in a world gone mad.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/0e3f5429b75f15ca897d228782803cfa.poster.avif?t=1726139760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/0e3f5429b75f15ca897d228782803cfa.webm?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/0e3f5429b75f15ca897d228782803cfa.mp4?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this narrative-driven game, you'll explore the unsettling intersection of lust and fear. The protagonist is drawn into a world of pervasive sexual tension and horrific danger, with each encounter presenting explicit adult scenes designed to shock, stimulate, and provoke.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/f7b8be68784fdaf0a3d9607c19849c82.poster.avif?t=1726139760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/f7b8be68784fdaf0a3d9607c19849c82.webm?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/f7b8be68784fdaf0a3d9607c19849c82.mp4?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The gameplay fuses strategic combat with provocative sexual contexts, challenging players to adapt and survive in a world of unflinching eroticism and terror. Balance exploration, puzzle-solving, and combat as you navigate through graphic scenes that will test your limits and redefine your understanding of interactive adult content.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/440d533cb26e4e3438f4b93a1d2982af.poster.avif?t=1726139760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/440d533cb26e4e3438f4b93a1d2982af.webm?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/440d533cb26e4e3438f4b93a1d2982af.mp4?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rendered in a realistic art style, &quot;The Last Orgasm&quot; presents a uniquely adult world wrapped in a deeply unsettling atmosphere. The mature storyline incorporates sexual themes with unexpected moments of humor and horror, weaving an immersive and complex narrative that will keep you on edge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/e705ce620b652d8817d304db951e6afc.poster.avif?t=1726139760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/e705ce620b652d8817d304db951e6afc.webm?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/e705ce620b652d8817d304db951e6afc.mp4?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;The Last Orgasm&quot; is a titillating journey into the darker corners of human desire, layered with intense combat and adult-only content that challenges conventional gaming norms. Steel yourself for an unprecedented gaming experience that pushes the boundaries of explicit interactive entertainment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/9fc66cab8e41e5078e4fcf1b8debd21d.poster.avif?t=1726139760\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/9fc66cab8e41e5078e4fcf1b8debd21d.webm?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407310/extras/9fc66cab8e41e5078e4fcf1b8debd21d.mp4?t=1726139760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
